  <History Date="30-09-20" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from CLF Orion" Version="3" />
  <History Date="03-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed gobo 2 slot 9 and corrected Cy/ 260 split colour and gobo 1 shake open dmx ranges in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request (note original charts and those in manual detail 9 slots for gobo 2)" Version="4" />
  <History Date="03-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Hybride to Hybrid (name provided in original request and associated documentation was incorrect)." Version="4" />
  <History Date="03-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo swatches (poor quality source).  Added Atlabase IDs.  Added physical pan/tilt ranges.  Fixed frost close pulse display range." Version="4" />
  <History Date="04-05-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed hotspot functions from reserved3 control." Version="5" />
